GET {{baseUrl}}

### ============================================
### COMPLETE WORKFLOW EXAMPLE
### ============================================

### 1. Register as ONG Manager
# POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
# Save the token from response

### 2. Login
# POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
# Update @token variable with the received token

### 3. Get My Profile
# GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### 4. Create Products
# POST {{baseUrl}}/products
# Save product IDs

### 5. List My Products
# GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### 6. Register as Customer
# POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
# Update @token with customer token

### 7. Browse Public Products
# GET {{baseUrl}}/public/products

### 8. Search Products
# POST {{baseUrl}}/public/search

### 9. Create Order
# POST {{baseUrl}}/orders

### 10. View My Orders
# GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
